{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05945","headline":"送李睢阳 · 王维","name":"送李睢阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将置酒，思悲翁。\n使君去，出城东。\n麦渐渐，雉子斑。\n槐阴阴，到潼关。\n骑连连，车迟迟。\n心中悲，宋又远。\n周间之，南淮夷。\n东齐儿，碎碎织练与素丝。\n游人贾客信难持，五谷前熟方可爲。\n下车闭合君当思，天子当殿俨衣裳。\n大官尚食陈羽觞，彤庭散绶垂鸣璫。\n黄纸诏书出东厢，轻纨叠绮烂生光。\n宗室子弟君最贤，分忧当爲百辟先。\n布衣一言相爲死，何况圣主恩如天。\n鸾声哕哕鲁侯旗，明年上计朝京师。\n须忆今日斗酒别，慎勿富贵忘我爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05945.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05945","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}